title = {A novel analyzing quality of service (throughput) for secure documents storage in cloud computing based on attributes based framework compared with service measure index framework},
abstract = {Aim: The main aim of the research work is to analyze the quality of service in secure document storage in cloud computing using the Attribute-Based Framework (ABF) and compare it with the Service Measure Index framework (SMI). Materials and Methods: Considering two groups as Attribute Based Framework and Service Measure Index. For each framework take N = 10 from the dataset to perform both iterations on each framework value. There was a statistical significance between the ABF and SMI (p = 0.005) which was found with the SPSS statistical tool. Result and Discussion: The developed service of securing the document can encrypt the document and decrypt the document with a symmetric key using the ABF with the less throughput of (0.59) over SMI throughput of (1.10). Conclusion: The analysis of service in secure document storage in cloud computing has been analyzed and shows that the ABF is better than SMI.},
