abstract = {Welcome to CMSBSE 2013, the First International Workshop on Combining Modelling and Search-Based Software Engineering, held 20 May 2013 in San Francisco, USA, and co-located with the 2013 ACM/IEEE International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE 2013).

